Package: kelpbiodata
Title: Kelp Biomass Data and Reference Fits for 'kelpbio'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Seb", "Dalgarno", , "seb@poissonconsulting.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3658-4517")),
    person("Tula Foundation", role = c("fnd", "cph")))
Description: Field survey datasets for Nereocystis luetkeana and Macrocystis
    pyrifera, and models fitted to them with the 'kelpbio' package. The
    reference fits can be used in place of fitting a sub-model to new data.
